type: software
title: "Erdős problem 142 research pack"
abstract: >-
  Public offline research notes, finite verifiers, and progress reports
  toward a density-increment approach related to Erdős problem 142 and the
  local target r_4(N)=o(N/log N). The problem remains open. No closed
  proof or prize claim is made in this record.
